Exactly one file is taken from ValveSoftware/gamescope: the description of the private
protocol `protocol/gamescope-action-binding.xml`, vendored as
`docs/spikes/gamescope-hotkey/gamescope-action-binding.xml`. The file carries
its own license header (MIT) and is included without changes; the header text
is duplicated below.

poe-deck contains no gamescope code: the marshalling is generated from the XML
(wayland-scanner). It is derived from the protocol description, not from the compositor implementation.

